  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in the ceramic tagine over medium heat.",
    "Add the onion and garlic and cook until the onion is translucent.",
    "Add the tempeh and cook for 5 minutes.",
    "Add the dried apricots, prunes, chicken broth, and spices, and stir to combine.",
    "Bring the mixture to a boil, then reduce the heat to low and simmer for 30 minutes.",
    "Season with salt and pepper to taste.",
    "Serve the tagine hot, garnished with fresh parsley or cilantro."
